Package: ftrend
Type: Package
Title: Nonparametric Trend Estimation in Functional Time Series
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Israel", "Martínez-Hernández", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "i.martinez@lancaster.ac.uk")
Description: Estimates the deterministic trend T(s, t) of a functional time
    series Y_n(s) = T(s, n/N) + X_n(s) by a penalised tensor product of
    B-splines with marginal roughness penalties, as proposed by
    Martínez-Hernández and Genton (2021) <doi:10.1111/biom.13353>. Curves may
    be observed on a common grid or on curve-specific grids. Smoothing
    parameters are selected by restricted maximum likelihood on marginal
    means.
License: GPL (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/Martinez-Hernandez/Nonparametric-Trend-Estimation-in-Functional-TS
BugReports: https://github.com/Martinez-Hernandez/Nonparametric-Trend-Estimation-in-Functional-TS/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: splines, stats, graphics, grDevices, mgcv, nlme
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown, demography
